<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24426" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inter-quĭesco</span></b> ,
			quĭēvi, quĭētum,
		3, v. n., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to rest between whiles</i>, <i>rest a
				while</i>, <i>pause</i>, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, of persons: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bibe, interquiesce,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 159</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cum haec dixissem et paululum interquievissem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Brut. 23, 91</span></i>
			. — </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, of things: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dolor,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen.
					Ep. 78</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lites,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					Ep. 8, 21</span></i>
			.</div>
